{"job_id":"F-3c963b359b7f002608c6","family_id":"F-3c963b359b7f002608c6","title":"국가에 귀속하는 상속재산 이전에 관한 법률","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001238-96889-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":23,"target_id":"2ffdf8a06f2eb94c1f251708fc1bc36d7192e44a630982112e1d2a7d577ba1a8","source_hash":"5b5c36bab9a6ca963df2ea1e956a0f319cada704d0fd1353c9caaff3a8300743","text":"关于转移居住于该州的继承财产的法令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001238-96889-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":119,"target_id":"bdb787d28aa6317d6df1a5b8535e87cd5aa1ead4a04746b8c9c325d1a168efcc","source_hash":"353ec1cae3e9ee39dc95a28da03c6c9949492204b3a46707fc1f765c396af276","text":"第一条（国内财产转移）根据《民法》第1058条第1款的规定，归还国家的继承财产的管理人应当立即将该继承财产的管理权移交给死者住所地税务局局长。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001238-96889-ko","scope":"BODY","start":119,"end":236,"target_id":"50bb9103802b18c225a0e855f30e7cb46e060a0e6916583e5280afd8e8015f3c","source_hash":"0c43dd330becb491bb61d0da260dbcf3827b277522ca9628b7eccc4ff629909d","text":"第二条（财产移送境外）第一条所述情形，死者住所地在外国时，继承财产的管理权应当立即移送至对该住所地有管辖权的领事或者履行领事职责的人。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001238-96889-ko","scope":"BODY","start":236,"end":337,"target_id":"736265cefb12080835e403f58850a5991d4f00355053c796a87f33e0e0f751f0","source_hash":"824df671dad1f40aaa0e02f8d4dac6df0d75e80e5009d9ddc77b6e58f7c04bae","text":"补充条款 <第860条，1961年12月23日>\n\n①本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n兹废止丹吉年间（公元4232年）第409号法令，该法令涉及继承人作出最终决定后归还国库的财产的交付。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001238-96889-ko","scope":"BODY","start":337,"end":379,"target_id":"e210c0d331de331f867b84ef08ceb12168aff2ba3ba4766f7e1540c9f8715fa6","source_hash":"f9e2d9e449d480549505758ab8fa9fbc1d80d689279a652e1faa28140ef1654e","text":"补充规定 <第9806号，2009年10月21日>\n\n本法自颁布之日起生效。"}]}